  "description": "Steep hills and longer distances are no sweat with the Amalgam electric bike by Schwinn. You can go further and faster than ever before thanks to the Amalgam’s pedal assist 250 watt hub motor that adds a quiet boost each time you pedal. The battery is integrated into the downtube of the bike’s aluminum dual sport frame for a lower center of gravity and a more stable ride. The suspension fork smooths out bumps in the road, while the 27.5-inch wheels are great for both trails and pavement. Plus, the 7-speed drivetrain and mechanical disc brakes complete the package. Like all Schwinn bikes, the Amalgam comes with a limited lifetime warranty for as long as you own the bike (2 year warranty on battery and electric assist parts). Get more out of every ride with the Amalgam. Enjoy the freedom of riding a Schwinn.",
